                    h2.mb-5 Selected Academic Projects

                    .mb-4
                        h3.mb-0 File System Lab
                        .subheading.mb-2 Prof. Erez Zadok &mdash; Jan 2020 - Dec 2020
                        ul.mb-0
                            li Built a log aggregator to collect logs from different host machines and added search to retrieve filtered results.
                            li Used LogStash, FileBeat, Kafka and Kibana to consolidate and store the results.

                    .mb-4
                        h3.mb-0 Depression Tendency in Twitter Users
                        .subheading.mb-2 Natural Language Processing, Prof. Niranjan &mdash; Sep 2020 - Dec 2020
                        ul.mb-0
                            li Retrieved tweets using Selenium and scripts, and removed bias from the dataset by manual annotation of tweets.
                            li Applied BiLSTM with Attention and the state-of-the-art RoBERTa model, achieving 92.5% accuracy.

                    .mb-4
                        h3.mb-0 Do Popular Movies Endure Over Time?
                        .subheading.mb-2 Prof. Steven Skiena &mdash; Oct 2019 - Nov 2019
                        ul.mb-0
                            li Developed a statistical model to predict the current popularity of old movies using IMDB and Kaggle datasets.
                            li Applied different machine learning models to calculate the endurance of movies using a designed metric.

                    .mb-4
                        h3.mb-0 Offline Signature Forgery Detection
                        .subheading.mb-2 Prof. Akriti Nigam &mdash; Jan 2017 - May 2017
                        ul.mb-0
                            li Created a model based on individuals' real and forged signatures, using the CEDAR database to train the model.
                            li Applied machine learning techniques like SVM and ANN and compared their sensitivity and specificity.

                    .mb-4
                        h3.mb-0 Music Service Website
                        .subheading.mb-2 Feb 2015 - Apr 2015
                        ul.mb-0
                            li Developed a music streaming website hosted on the college network, with options to add songs and build personalized playlists.
                            li Delivered back-end RESTful APIs to download songs in this interactive web application.
                            li Made the website and hosted it on LAN at college over a personal IP, comprising a songs playlist shared by users.

                    .mb-4
                        h3.mb-0 Networking and Website Designing
                        .subheading.mb-2 Netcamp Summer Training &mdash; 2015
                        ul.mb-0
                            li Worked on Samba file transfer between Red Hat Linux (on VMware) and Windows, including permission settings.
                            li Configured mail transfer using Webmin (primarily GUI-based administration).

                    .mb-0
                        h3.mb-0 Airline Reservation System (ARS)
                        .subheading.mb-2 May 2014 - Present
                        p Replicated an airline website with core features including ticket booking and cancellation, flight enquiries, pricing for flights over the next 2 weeks, PNR checking, and online check-in, along with several other functions.
                        p.mb-0 Built on a WAMP server using PHP, HTML, CSS (basic), MySQL (database), JavaScript (basic) and Ajax (basic).

